 # UnderWeb X changelog
 
+## 0.5.5-rc14 — Event Mode
+
+Command → **Event Mode**: pick an event type and press Start.
+- Switches UWX into that event's setup: group invites in our instances, automatic friend invites to the chosen audience, an invite message, and a chatbox line (shown even if your Statuses module is off).
+- Live panel: who's here now, peak, how many came by, group and friend invites sent during the event, and which UnderWeb staff are in the lobby.
+- End event puts your usual invite and chatbox settings back exactly as they were, and saves a recap. "Copy recap" gives a Discord-ready summary (names only — no IDs, instances or locations).
+- Comes with Music Video Night, Cinema Night, Hub Hangout and Staff Meeting. Edit them or add your own (e.g. Halloween Party).
+- If UWX is closed mid-event, the event resumes when you reopen it.
+- Old Event Mode card (which only mirrored the website) replaced; upcoming website events can be used as tonight's name.
+
 ## 0.5.4-rc13 — Safe, automatic updates
 
 - **Fixed a serious updater bug**: UWX was still checking VRCX's update server. As soon as stock VRCX published a newer version, UWX would have downloaded it and offered to install it, replacing UnderWeb X. UWX now only updates from UnderWeb X's own releases on GitHub.
